; The thumbnail child's Seatbelt profile (macOS): everything is denied but
; what a process needs to start (Apple's bsd.sb) and running the program
; itself, PROGRAM. The child keeps what it was handed: stdin (the original),
; stdout and stderr. Used by thumbnail::sandbox::seatbelt.
(version 1)
(deny default)
(import "bsd.sb")
(allow process-exec (literal (param "PROGRAM")))
